{'symbol': 'DXCM', 'date': '2022-08-31 17:00:00', 'title': 'DEXCOM PROMOTES JAKE LEACH TO CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER', 'text': "SAN DIEGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $DXCM #CGM--DEXCOM, INC. (NASDAQ: DXCM), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN REAL-TIME CONTINUOUS GLUCOSE MONITORING FOR PEOPLE WITH DIABETES, ANNOUNCED TODAY THE PROMOTION OF JAKE LEACH TO THE ROLE OF CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER. LEACH HAS MOST RECENTLY SERVED AS CHIEF TECHNOLOGY OFFICER AT DEXCOM SINCE 2018, LEADING THE ORGANIZATION'S RESEARCH, PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT, PROJECT MANAGEMENT AND ENGINEERING DEPARTMENTS. AN 18-YEAR VETERAN OF THE COMPANY, JAKE JOINED DEXCOM IN 2004 TO LEAD THE DEVELOPMEN"}